This Easter Rhythm Culture provided a vacation care incursion for [Bethany Lutheran Primary](https://www.bethany.qld.edu.au/) School for the [Queensland Lutheran Early Childhood Services](https://qlecs.org.au/) in Raceview.  
  
We ran a [Drum Sing Dance vacation care incursion](/vacation-care/) for Bethany Lutheran the children outside in a large undercover basketball court. Weather was fine and the breeze was lovely in the cool undercover spot.  
  
The children at Bethany Lutheran Primary School were super keen to get into the drumming and our highlight was definitely one little boy who was so engaged and excited it was as though the rest of the world had ceased existing for that brief hour. He jumped up and danced solos, demonstrated a drumming solo and sang at the top of his lungs with a beautiful singing voice.  
  
Thanks for having us Qld Lutheran Early Childhood Services. We look forward to seeing you all again soon!

[![](/media/2022/04/bethany-lutheran.png)](/media/2022/04/bethany-lutheran.png)

Bethany Lutheran Primary School was a 2020 Australia Education Awards Finalist. To find out more about Bethany Lutheran Primary School see [here](https://www.bethany.qld.edu.au/).
